Package: skanyxx
Version: SKANYXX_VERSION
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Skanyxx <admin@skanyxx.dev>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3
Recommends: curl, xdg-utils, libnotify-bin
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/skanyxx/skanyxx
Description: Skanyxx desktop launcher
 Opens your company's Skanyxx agent workspace (Skanyxx:RemoteUrl, Mode
 Remote) in the browser; nothing listens on this machine unless the optional
 skanyxx service is enabled. The Skanyxx server itself is installed with the
 Helm chart; a full local Skanyxx (Mode Server) is a dev console only.
